@startuml G61-ship-release
!include ../includes/C4_Sequence_Macros.puml

title G61 — Ship release (freeze snapshot)\nProfile Gates: cyber_gate trigger + gate_signoff pass (ARCH-CYBER-GATE)

C4Seq_User()
C4Seq_WebUI()
C4Seq_RouteGuard()
C4Seq_API()
C4Seq_RBAC()
C4Seq_Business()
C4Seq_Data()
C4Seq_Postgres()
C4Seq_Audit()
C4Seq_OTEL()

note over seqUser, seqOTEL
  **Soft:** `release.cyber_gate` = **trigger**
  (when true AND profile enables gate-cyber-ship,
  cyber ship Gate evaluates).
  **gate_signoff rows** (D39g) = **pass condition**
  checked by gate-signoff-complete.
  Optional gate-verification-ship / gate-no-open-suspect
  skipped when disabled on profile.
end note

== Ship ==

seqUser -> seqWebUI : Ship release
RbacRouteGuard("release:ship")
ClientScopedQuery("POST", "/clients/{clientId}/releases/{id}:ship")
ControlNote(seqAPI, "SC-8, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Freeze delivers snapshot; deny if gates fail")

seqAPI -> seqBusiness : shipRelease(actor, releaseId)
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "CM-3, AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "ActionHook release:ship under WorkflowProfile")

RbacCheck("release:ship")
ControlNote(seqRBAC, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Release manager (or bound role)")

HookEval("release:ship")
ControlNote(seqData, "CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "hook-ship: cyber, verification, signoff-complete, no-open-suspect")

GateCheck("gate-cyber-ship")
note right of seqBusiness
  Evaluated when **cyber_gate=true** AND
  profile enables gate-cyber-ship (trigger).
  Predicate may require Security+AO slots
  via RoleBinding; unsigned → deny.
end note
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "cyber_gate is trigger, not a mega-status (ARCH-GATE-MODEL)")

GateCheck("gate-verification-ship")
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Optional; skipped when disabled on profile")

GateCheck("gate-signoff-complete")
note right of seqBusiness
  **Pass condition:** required gate_signoff rows
  exist for security_signoff + ao_approve
  when cyber path is active (FIX-DENY-SHIP-UNSIGNED).
end note
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, AU-2", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "gate_signoff rows from D39g are the pass condition")

GateCheck("gate-no-open-suspect")
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Optional ARCH-SUSPECT gate; off in commercial default")

== Mutate: freeze snapshot ==

seqBusiness -> seqData : freeze release snapshot (delivers UIDs)
seqData -> seqPostgres : UPDATE release status=shipped;\nlock delivers membership
ControlNote(seqPostgres, "CM-3, AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Shipped delivers immutable for migrate lock rule")
seqPostgres --> seqData : ok
seqData --> seqBusiness : release

HookEffectsAfter("audit")
AuditLog("release.ship", "releaseId")
ControlNote(seqAudit, "AU-2, AU-3, AU-12", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Auditable ship with gate outcomes")

seqBusiness --> seqAPI : release DTO
seqAPI --> seqWebUI : 200 OK
seqWebUI --> seqUser : shipped snapshot

@enduml
